A||||28||2M4 Dale||2nd Annual Cookout / Campout and Ames Performance Pontiac Nationals||||4||
Z||000000||2M4 Dale||07-28-2001||11:43 AM||||	It's that time again !!! Christine and I are planning our cookout / campout for Saturday, August 11th. We will cookout and hangout and perhaps take a small cruise somewhere.....Last year we had quite a good turnout and we hope to have you all back and more ! <BR>	Last year we cruised to The old Mansfield State Reformatory where the film Shawshank Redemtion was filmed.......Some of us stayed and toured the facility. If I could get some more feedback from Y'all maybe we could do that again or maybe not. The old prison has made it to the ranks of one of the  "Scariest Places in the World".<BR>	We have 4 acres and anyone who chooses to do so may set up a tent and campout. We will have a campfire and plenty of conversation. All I ask is that if you wish to drink, thats fine, but please wait till any driving for the day is over. We do want to keep all our Friends in one piece....not to mention thier Fieros...lol<BR>	OK, here is an important note ! Dinner should be ready starting at around 4:00 so plan to arrive at anytime between 2:00 and 4:00. Chris and I will be providing most of the food...(HOT DOGS, etc.)...but...we could use your help. Please bring a covered dish or some chips or some pop or something. I will also have some beer but you may feel free to bring your own. <BR>	The following morning, Sunday the 12th we will cruise to Norwalk to the Ames Performance Pontiac Nationals. This is a COOL event ! All Pontiac Car Show and Swap Meet and Drags. Admission into Norwalk Raceway Park is as follows :  <BR>                                                      1. Wanna Drag  $60.00<BR>                                                      2. Car Show      $22.00<BR>                                                      3. General Ad    $15.00<BR>                                                      4. Car Corral      $20.00<BR>                                                      5. Swap Vendor $40.00<P>We had a real good time last year so please try to attend.....RSVP via email.<P>Dale and Chris Starcher<BR>2585 Vantilburg Rd<BR>Mansfield, Ohio 44903<BR>||||reg||4
Z||000001||87ECO5||07-28-2001||01:35 PM||||We're there, Dale!  Lisa, the kids and I can't wait!  I'll bring my world famous Gooey Bars and some stuff to drink.  Do you need anything else?<P>I didn't tour the prison last year but I'm very interested in doing that this year.  Any idea what the price is?<P>Also, and I hate to say this for fear of jinxing it but, will you still have the outing if it's raining?<P>Finally, any idea where I can get a good car trailer?  I don't want to put miles on that garage queen of mine!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">   ha ha   j/k<P>Thanks for doing this again.  We all had an absolute blast (Bill too, I think) last year!||||reg||14
