Z||000021||2M4 Dale||08-08-2001||12:34 AM||||WOW an added attraction for my campout....Don't Miss This Brilliant Meteor Shower! <BR>In the next few days, you can witness the Perseid meteor shower coming to its peak performance. Just head outdoors on a clear night (best viewing time is after midnight), look up in the northeastern part of the sky and you'll see loads of shooting stars. The shower will reach its most spectacular moments in the wee hours of August 12. Most meteors are observed as a bright streak across the sky that can last for several seconds, but occasionally a large fragment will explode in a multicolored fireball. <P>||||reg||4
